# JSON text. toJson value encodes a value: records (and HashMaps with string
# keys) become objects, lists arrays, Bool true/false, integers exact numbers,
# Floats numbers; prettyJson encodes it indented by two spaces. fromJson text
# decodes one: objects become records (names as plain keys, others quoted, so
# r.status and r."Content-Type"), arrays lists, numbers Int or Float, null [].
